{"Logical operator `&&` should be `||` in isTeamAdminOrOwner check - requires user to be BOTH admin AND owner, blocking team admins who aren't owners from adding guests": 0.9748436808586121, "Raw `guests` array passed to sendAddGuestsEmails instead of `uniqueGuests`, causing existing attendees to incorrectly receive AttendeeScheduledEmail instead of AttendeeAddGuestsEmail": 0.9218050837516785, "Guest name set to empty string propagates blank names to calendar events and email templates, producing email subjects with blank name placeholders": 0.8883076310157776, "Calendar update failure via eventManager.updateCalendarAttendees is unhandled - no try/catch means guests saved in DB but calendar not updated, leaving DB and calendar out of sync with no rollback": 0.9468364119529724, "No upper bound on guests array in schema (z.array with no .max() limit) allows unbounded input causing mass DB inserts, calendar API calls, and email sends": 0.8482096791267395}